 excited about this  development but we need to temper our  expectations  that's because REM de Sevilla is an  extremely short supply its producer  Gilead Sciences said it was increasing  the global supply but it expected  availability to be extremely limited for  the next few months there are many drugs  being trialed and tested but it looks  like REM de severe is the one that  offers the best hope until a vaccine is  found it may be the only choice Joshy  Sky News
 

